      "exhaustion": "Four guarded visits unroll the fixed native for-loop. advance marks done after the fourth child or the first failure without keep_going; later guards skip calls. No fifth visit, retry or convergence is possible. The prior loop on_exhausted path was unreachable with this registry.",
      "compiler_lowering": "Four guarded visits preserve the fixed registry loop without a branch-local loop, which Lunar currently cannot compile."
    }
  }
